# Build and package outputs (including generated assets)
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/build
**/packages
**/_node_modules

# Logs and backups
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.backup

# Node.js and frontend artifacts
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Tests and build caches
**/TestResults

# Coverage and Python caches
**/coverage
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]

# System-generated files
**/*.db
**/Thumbs.db
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Icon?
**/Desktop.ini
**/.DS_Store

